<title>HONG KONG: Dao Heng names global private banking GM.</title>
<headline>Dao Heng names global private banking GM.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dao Heng Bank Ltd said Tuesday it has named Timothy Gibbs as general manager of its global private banking division.</p>
<p>Gibbs will lead the further development of Dao Heng's private banking division to meet customers' increasingly sophisticated requirements for personalised and professional investment, the bankk said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
